stones/72/labels","id":5556070,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTU1NjA3MA==","number":72,"title":"1.5.2.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":30,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-06-18T09:45:13Z","updated_at":"2020-06-18T23:43:46Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-06-18T23:43:46Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2020-06-12T13:13:20Z","updated_at":"2020-06-18T09:46:14Z","closed_at":"2020-06-14T09:27:35Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nNullPointerException is thrown in QuarkusTestException.runExtensionMethod (line 498 in 1.5.1.Final) because runningQuarkusApplication is null, whereby exception that caused boot to fail is swallowed.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nReal cause of failure should be reported.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\n```\r\njava.lang.NullPointerException\r\n\tat io.quarkus.test.junit.QuarkusTestExtension.runExtensionMethod(QuarkusTestExtension.java:498)\r\n\tat io.quarkus.test.junit.QuarkusTestExtension.interceptBeforeAllMethod(QuarkusTestExtension.java:365)\r\n\tat org.junit.jupiter.engine.execution.ExecutableInvoker$ReflectiveInterceptorCall.lambda$ofVoidMethod$0(ExecutableInvoker.java:115)\r\n\tat org.junit.jupiter.engine.execution.ExecutableInvoker.lambda$invoke$0(ExecutableInvoker.java:105)\r\n\tat org.junit.jupiter.engine.execution.InvocationInterceptorChain$InterceptedInvocation.proceed(InvocationInterceptorChain.java:106)\r\n\tat org.junit.jupiter.engine.extension.TimeoutExtension.intercept(TimeoutExtension.java:149)\r\n\tat org.junit.jupiter.engine.extension.TimeoutExtension.interceptLifecycleMethod(TimeoutExtension.java:126)\r\n\tat org.junit.jupiter.engine.extension.TimeoutExtension.interceptBeforeAllMethod(TimeoutExtension.java:68)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nLooking into the code: QuarkusTestExtension.interceptBeforeAllMethod (see exception stack trace above)\r\n1. ensureStarted is called\r\n2. doJavaStart is called\r\n3. let assume exception is thrown before runningQuarkusApplication is initialized, e.g. in hibernate drop-and-create routine, i.e. runningQuarkusApplication is null\r\n4. exception (or error) is caught in ensureStarted and saved as firstException field and failedBoot=true\r\n5. returned from ensureStarted\r\n6. runExtensionMethod is called\r\n7. attempt to access runningQuarkusApplication results in NPE. (q.e.d.)\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4374975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand","html_url":"https://github.com/geoand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/starred{/owner}{/repo}